{"server":"tw","storyId":"act15side_level_act15side_02_beg","groupId":"act15side","stageId":"act15side_02","title":"無尋處","storyCode":"IW-2","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_02_beg.txt","sourceHash":"8f363790262f470704cb863b134c5e3e826d3796bd08260226e8246ec2265429","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"老鯉與舊友梁洵相談甚歡，但克洛絲卻遇到了曾在龍門與羅德島有過一面之緣的太合與一位神秘少年。而等到老鯉回房歇息，卻有一位意外來客等著他。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"2上"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g10_lianghouse"},{"type":"narration","text":"春寒料峭。\n讓人回想起了不少過去的畫面，求學，經商，習武，從政。\n那段歲月裡，我們似乎形影不離。身邊有良師益友，各懷抱負，想大展宏圖。\n現在呢？\n青磚許久未曾打掃，雖然開春已久，仍有殘雪，白如玉。\n不知道門關著時，門後人在想什麼。只知道門開了後，你知道的，就都是那人想讓你知道的。\n男人抬起頭，大門吱呀作響。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不苟言笑的男子","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......梁洵，很久沒見了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很久不見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一路辛苦了，鯉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"千里迢迢，很難說句不辛苦。梁大人好大的排場，就為了讓我送個小物件，要我走這麼遠的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有空我會和你解釋的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慎師傅，你也辛苦了，早春時分，江上遊客挺多的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪裡，答應了梁大人的事，我自然會優先照顧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然人已帶到......我就先回碼頭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了。剛才在城裡起了些風波，具體的就讓鯉小子告訴你吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......風波？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人，您也要多多注意才是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就先走一步啦，碼頭那邊估計缺人手，我得趕緊回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，辛苦了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“從爭山渡進入尚蜀，找一位姓慎的船夫。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人挺大牌面，只靠這一句話，就打發了我一個初來乍到的外鄉人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也不算第一次來尚蜀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慎師傅是什麼人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是個信得過的碼頭師傅。一位經驗老道的船夫，比什麼都可信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過這幾位是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我才反應過來，梁大人，說的是尚蜀知府！？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我已經習慣你才反應過來這件事了。這算是個什麼概念？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哦，就是市長！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......可按大炎官職，不該比魏彥吾低多了嗎？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這二位是我如今的......合作夥伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"見過梁大人。在下楚......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請叫我克洛絲，我是來自羅德島製藥公司的行動幹員，如今與鯉先生是合作關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過這一次其實是在尚蜀偶然碰見的，總之打擾梁大人啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"偶然？我還以為，他們是你從龍門招來的信使......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你還記得有“信使”這個職業，你就該讓信使來替你跑腿，不是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"茲事體大，路途遙遠，我不放心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我來就放心了？你可饒了我吧，要是遇到什麼剪徑賊，我怎麼脫身？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你如果真嫌麻煩，大可以回信拒絕我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"得了吧，得到那物件的機會轉瞬即逝，你的信前腳剛到，那些走私販後腳就到龍門了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我哪有回信讓你另請高明的時間？還不是得趕緊安排人手調查，順便搗毀一下走私集團的老巢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，幸好我家幾位員工能者多勞，我才有空幫你這個忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（聽上去像是槐琥小姐做的啊......鯉先生大概是覺得待在龍門事更多，索性找個藉口溜走的吧......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然幾位都是鯉的合作夥伴，那就別站在門口發呆了，快進來吧，府上還是有幾間客房的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有幸受到尚蜀知府親自招待，那我們便恭敬不如從命了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幾位也請。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......謝過梁大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人，正好愁不知何處落腳呢，反正離約定的時辰還早，不如我們先休憩一會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼......我可能有點累著了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鯉先生，剛才發生的事情要和梁大人交代嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看這天色，雲繚霧繞，怕是夜裡要下雨吧——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g07_fairyland_2"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g10_lianghouse"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g07_fairyland_2"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g10_lianghouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......？怎麼了，鯉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是腦海裡突然閃過了一些景色，可能確實太久沒來過尚蜀了，有些懷念吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g02_yanalley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......杜小姐，怎樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能怎樣，鄭老頭把我罵了一頓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像我說的，不能總聽他們的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽他們的，我們就再也沒有半點未來可言了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按我說的做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。那我把大家都喊上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那您下一步打算怎麼處理那個龍門人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我去親自見見他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有些話，還是得敞開了說。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g11_yanroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喝酒嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不了。一會還有工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"千里迢迢為你送來一隻酒盞，而你卻不肯陪我小酌一杯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了取這一隻盞，我可費了不少功夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喝酒誤事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喝酒誤事啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當年梁洵總喜歡把這句話掛在嘴邊，現在我也很高興知道，梁大人依然不勝酒力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也很高興知道，你仍舊是那個嘴上不饒人的老鯉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行裕客棧的事情我已經派人前去調查了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看上去沒那麼簡單。你要是真不知情，也就別亂摻和了，江湖事嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乾脆等我離開尚蜀，逃之夭夭，一了百了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就不想看看酒盞是否安好？一路顛簸，要是我不小心一屁股坐碎了，也是極有可能的嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒主動提起，就說明酒盞無恙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是看看吧，專程從龍門送來的寶貝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這就是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很好奇，這隻酒盞有什麼特別的？在那場走私商人們的拍賣會上，這隻酒盞的價格就和附贈品沒什麼兩樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唯一值得留意的，就是在那些走私販之間流傳著一個說法，說最早發現這隻酒盞的村子裡流傳著一個怪談。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說說看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說是這隻酒盞，能讓周遭的器物......活過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......有證據嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怪談要是有證據，豈不是變成案件了？我本來就是聽來的嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些走私販呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都扭送到近衛局了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實，我還要委託你一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是，畢竟都大老遠把我從龍門叫來了，只使喚一下怎麼成？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過現在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵。看來不陪你喝一杯，你是不會放我走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那公事之後再提吧，你還是一點沒變，優哉遊哉的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"坐吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你倒成主人的語氣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在龍門日子如何？聽說你在那邊當了私家偵探？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊......槐武癡的女兒也在我那。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔。難怪你突然說，要我幫忙找找他的下落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我照顧槐琥也有段時日了，她的大學畢業典禮都是我去的。怎麼，難道以後嫁人了，也讓我坐高堂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"槐琥是個好女孩。但她爹還真不算什麼好父親。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的女兒......也已經這麼大了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時間過得很快，梁洵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說你入了仕途，猜到以你的性格，一定會大展拳腳，有一番作為。可誰也沒想到，咱們一別就是這麼多年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能振作起來，大家都會很欣慰的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"談不上振作，只是有些事情煩惱久了，發現還沒有柴米油鹽麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好久沒嘗過你親手做的菜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經是一城百姓的父母官了，就別總惦記著以前我們過苦日子時候的生活啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你該多惦記惦記，別讓太多那樣的青年俊傑懷才不遇，拳腳無處伸展。這不是當年梁洵最憤憤不平的事情嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，不過幸好，你還是老樣子，根本沒有女人緣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還擔心若是這一趟尚蜀之行，發現你早就成家立業，那我豈不是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......梁大人，你有客人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寧小姐......現在不方便......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——沒什麼不方便的，我只是個信使，一會就離開！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......晚上好，梁大人，還有這位......信使先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒錯，小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（你給解釋解釋。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（共事關係。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哪有這個時間共事的？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（才剛過吃飯時間沒多久。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫非，梁大人忘了今晚我要來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您二位聊，我忽然想起還有事要辦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人，貨我就放在這裡了，您要是還有什麼用得著我的......呃，您先忙完正事再說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，鯉——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g10_lianghouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這下事情麻煩了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g02_yanalley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......小烏有，我們只是找個吃飯的地方，用得著這麼大費周章嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隨便找個地方打發一下不行嗎？反正年也不在，也沒人嚷嚷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這可不行！恩人，白天那事實在是對不住，我這不尋思著一定要給恩人找一家好的餐館賠個不是嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔......那為什麼會來這種連個人影都沒有的小巷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，恩人，您這就不明白了，每個大炎人都有幾家心目中的蒼蠅館子，那味道，是多少名聲在外的餐廳飯店都比不了的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吃的是回憶，品的是情懷，呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又不是尚蜀本地人......哪來什麼情懷中的飯館。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把那本旅遊雜誌收起來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的口袋是什麼百寶袋嗎，為什麼永遠有各種稀奇古怪的書籍......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......專挑小路走，是想把白天襲擊我們的人釣出來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然有知府大人為我們撐腰，我們怕什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說他們也不像是什麼正經的壞人，與其等著被找上門來，不如趁我們和其餘人會合之前，把事情徹底解決......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......最保險的辦法，應該是乖乖待在梁府，然後聯繫最近的辦事處幹員來尚蜀會合......嗯......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，之前我就想問了，羅德島的大炎人，多嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這麼一說，印象裡總覺得不算特別多，但又好像哪兒都能看見大炎人的影子，真奇妙——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"羅德島？羅德島......\n嗯。\n感染者竟在城內隨意走動？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g02_yanalley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——恩人，當心——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_040","isRemote":false,"text":"電光石火間竟能有如此反應。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_040","isRemote":false,"text":"實屬意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在做什麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"烏有的思考很快，動作更快，習武之人，多是如此。\n只是這一次，那壯漢的一擊掌刀，比烏有的身心都更快一些，直抵咽喉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_040","isRemote":false,"text":"勿輕舉妄動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......小烏有！別動手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_040","isRemote":false,"text":"你是否知曉同行此人的身份？你是否知道她是感染者組織的一員？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......恩人，不瞞您說，我大概動不了手......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且這人......是個官差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_040","isRemote":false,"text":"短兵，奇門扇類。爐火純青，但未經殺陣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_040","isRemote":false,"text":"不過貴在自知之明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是不是在哪裡見過......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_040","isRemote":false,"text":"未曾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_040","isRemote":false,"text":"可那位大理寺少卿似乎與你們不無干係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......驚蟄小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了！我以前在行動記錄裡看見過，你是......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"肅政院副監察御史，太合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"肅、肅政院......！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者，你來尚蜀何事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在勾吳城外發生了什麼？那夕為何擅離山頭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此事又與羅德島有何牽連？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（恩人，這是在說......夕小姐的事情？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無言以對嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閣下不需要試探羅德島，我們自然是有手續在身的......作為感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可要是問到我們幹員的私生活，我可就真的無可奉告啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說我是真不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......幹員？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歲獸化身竟是公司雇員，此事從未聽聞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來大理寺對待羅德島一事大有失職之嫌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是追著我們來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此言差矣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那也不肯放我們走囉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爾等配合調查，我自有定奪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的男聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"太合叔，不用這麼咄咄逼人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_i02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"左公子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"和藹的少年","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我已經從其他秉燭人那裡瞭解了一些情況，這幾位......羅德島相關人士，如今算是尚蜀知府的客人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"和藹的少年","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雖然他們與灰齊山一事牽連頗深，但並無明顯冒犯之舉，我想犯不著大動干戈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"和藹的少年","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，二位，太合叔平時沉默寡言，今天也不知怎麼了，這麼激動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我叫左樂，是一位......宮廷信使，這麼理解就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......羅德島幹員，克洛絲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島幹員，楚烏有。就是還沒入職。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"克洛絲姐，烏有哥，多有得罪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是......雖然太合叔失禮在先，但還是容我提醒一句。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"若是二位與那對姐妹牽扯不深，最好點到即止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"年是我的朋友兼同事，夕是我朋友的麻煩妹妹。這樣算不算“點到即止”呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......實話說的話，應該是“為時已晚”吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"感謝提醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"克洛絲姐姐，倒算是藝高人膽大了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g02_yanalley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我與太合叔還有公務在身，先行一步，再會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島一事，希望梁知府能給肅政院一個答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告辭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人！您沒事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......剛才嚇了一跳，扭到腳了，沒多大事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......小烏有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓肅政院副監察御史擔當扈從的“信使”，實在是有些扯了。總不能次次把人當傻子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且對方似乎對勾吳城灰齊山，就是前些日子我們的那場奇遇，一清二楚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然連傻子都能猜到那對姐妹的身份非同凡響，可這下還是有些......呃，超乎想像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......先回梁府吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在不是閒逛的時候，需要儘早和她們會合......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......可能是什麼小動物吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g10_lianghouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉聲歎氣可不是你的作風。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......或者，梁大人見到我，就這麼不高興嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事就不能來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們何日有空，一起去山上看戲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天還涼，聽說寧小姐最近身體抱恙，應該避免去山上才是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早春一向如此，反而更讓人想念數舟峰的熱茶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。如果有空，我陪你去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位是你的客人吧？你可不是個會和信使聊天的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“東西放那兒吧，別耽誤我工作”。你會這麼說吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你興許也不會說後半句，畢竟梁洵梁大人最懂禮數。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......瞞不過寧小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪裡人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼遠！啊......千里迢迢來找你，我是不是不該打擾你們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有的事，他不是會在意這種事情的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀......真稀奇，竟然還會有讓你說出這種話的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為你對誰都是那副若即若離的態度呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......咳。也沒有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他來做什麼的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我托他......有些事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一件小事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不遠千里，請來自己的故交好友，只為辦一件小事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人不願說，我不問就是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，人間萬事細如毛，梁大人若每件都要費神煩心，都要過問探尋......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"豈不是太過操勞？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g11_yanroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎麼記得這處客房，梁大人說是給我歇腳的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐不請自來就罷了，怎麼還泡上我的茶了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是梁大人的茶，又不是你的茶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本小姐還泡了你的那杯，知足吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杜小姐是打算繼續興師問罪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你猜猜看呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看這梁府景色不錯，杜小姐怎麼也不至於那麼大膽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不如先說說吧，你來這兒是做什麼的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你倒是遊刃有餘，還有工夫跟我聊天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你都泡了茶了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直說了，我來，是要你幫我個忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怪了，我以為你這個人生性多疑來著，這麼好說話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁洵都放你進來了，那我還擔心什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你和他認識？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......只是作為晚輩請求了一番梁大人罷了。家父與官府關係一向很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上次見面，我可還要搶你的貨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是梁大人的貨，又不是我的貨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻煩事他操心就好，我呢，就負責......見招拆招。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你真願意相信我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我犯不著和一個小姑娘記仇吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，誰都有年輕的時候，要擠眉弄眼裝出一副樣子來，好個面子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——誰、誰好面子！？我那是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和掌櫃的吵架了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我發現你這人，實在可怕得很。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起來散漫慵懶，萬事不在意，其實心裡面什麼都清楚——這樣的人，最可怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"起碼我不會第一次和人見面就抄起板凳砸人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說說吧。談買賣，還是要實誠一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鄭掌櫃......爹他接了朝廷貴人的委託，要取得你手裡的盞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能猜到個大概，可是你先前還在幫令尊，現在怎麼就改了主意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多的我不便說，只是，我不希望爹這件事辦成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不說原因，你是不是就不相信我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明知道答案的問題可以少問，這樣顯得更有城府。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果這件事辦成了，無論我做了多少，爹都會把功勞算在我頭上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鏢局仇家多，對頭也多。何況現在信使行業發達了，鏢局家大業大，卻還守著那些老規矩，更是慢人一步，容易遭人排擠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以爹總說，要我知道藏拙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"裝成一個紈絝子弟，每天花天酒地，就不會有太多人注意到我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，我再默默替朝廷辦好幾件差事，一來交好人情，二來，也算讓手下們心服口服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣，爹把家業交到我手上，他就放心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"掌櫃的就是掌櫃的，會打算盤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可這算盤上沒有我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要繼承鏢局的杜遙夜也好，整日混吃等死的杜大小姐也好，都是別人期望我變成的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想借此機會逼得鄭掌櫃撒不了手，自己就正好不去當這個新任大掌櫃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是也不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"朝堂大員來委託鏢局的情況著實少見，這筆買賣要是出了岔，爹不可能就這樣把鏢局交給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不少年輕同輩，都指望靠我給大家尋一條出路。我和他們說，只要爹這筆生意黃了，那鏢局自然就是年輕人說了算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你老老實實等著你爹把衣缽傳給你，不是也一樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不一樣。那只是讓我們服從安排罷了，傳承到我手上，我就必須聽規矩辦事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何況“規矩”可不止是我爹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你打算來找我......呃，幫忙，其實是為了和我演一齣戲囉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杜遙夜......是小姐的名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幹、幹嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"靚杪秋之遙夜兮，心繚悷而有哀。遙夜遙夜，遙遙長夜，不錯的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜本小姐更喜歡黃昏出遊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......既然是買賣，那你打算替我做些什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人想要你手裡的東西，朝廷的人，可你沒給。你知道這意味著什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我的朋友也沒讓我給啊，我的朋友何嘗就不是朝廷的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人專程托你來，應該有別的事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小事罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隨便吧，我不感興趣。只是事到如今，無論你打算怎麼做，都別想置身事外了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於我，會是你的幫手。起碼，我能保證最後你安然無恙回去龍門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......有道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼一言為定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......一言為定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，你倒是比我想的好說話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧，雖然我確實不太想當那個掌櫃，但如今年輕同輩裡可不少人都對長輩們頗有微詞，他們現在都聽我號令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你嘴上說不想當鏢局接班人，可你難道不正做著一樣的事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......時代不同罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說的是，說的是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總覺得你藏著什麼話，算了，再待下去被察覺到就麻煩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鄙人姓鯉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——好，姓鯉的，我們後會有期！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那掌櫃的看著慈眉善目，也有這麼個女兒啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"......鯉叔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"你要去找梁叔，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊。唉，真不想跑這趟遠門......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你老爹的事，我會額外留意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"運氣好的話，我還能把他揪回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉，別這樣，可別抱太大指望啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大炎幅員遼闊，想找一個不想被找到的人，談何容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......槐琥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你應該知道，要真打算找到他，真打算痛斥他責備他質問他，哪怕你不計前嫌，只想對他撒撒嬌，你都得親自去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有你趕上你那個瘋老爹的背影，他才會回頭看你。他就是這樣的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會在尚蜀待一段時日。如果有他的消息，我會告訴你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是......做好了準備，就去找我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g11_yanroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁洵那小子，還沒說接下來要做什麼，就把客人這麼晾在一邊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......茶不怎麼樣，這茶壺倒是有幾分漂亮。茶壺......確實漂亮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯......筆墨紙硯......這客房倒是古色古香的。梁洵的審美情趣真是從沒變過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哈欠）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......唔。舟車勞頓，累了，累了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不如小憩片刻，折騰來折騰去，睏死個人——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g06_mountainroad_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——這裡是？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇妙的物件","speakerId":"avg_npc_306_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","aliases":["槐琥"]}]}
